message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "TraceUI — Production & Education Studio"
abstract: >-
  A single-file, browser-based studio that turns a project idea into an explicit, reviewable
  specification and a single production brief for generative-AI tools. It provides two workspaces —
  education (learning objectives, teaching strategy, activities, assessment methods and an
  alignment matrix) and professional design (websites, digital products, UI/UX flows, accessible
  SVG, technical parameters and controlled AI handoff) — with defined human review points,
  accessibility expressed as checkable requirements, acceptance checks for the returned artefacts,
  and project export and import. The interface is available in six languages and the language of
  the generated material is chosen independently. The application runs entirely in the browser with
  no server, no account and no network requests.
